.001 2.002 1.35 3.413 3.352 3.413h12.605c2.054 0 3.34-1.411 3.34-3.413v-1.11c0-.766.415-1.171 1.183-1.171h6.228c4.141-.001 6.427 2.172 6.427 6.106v75.417c0 3.933-2.286 6.116-6.427 6.116Zm6.775-3.581h20.712c1.296 0 2.27-.924 2.27-2.282s-.973-2.27-2.269-2.27H21.055c-1.358 0-2.27.912-2.27 2.27s.912 2.282 2.27 2.282Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div> <div class="platform-label">iPhone</div></div> </section>  <div class="divider svelte-j9g7ud"></div> <section data-test-id="shelf-wrapper" class="shelf svelte-1svznay centered   padding-top padding-bottom"> <p class="svelte-1up5qog"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1dta22y" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 5);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1dta22y"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Play, Chat, and Connect – All in One Place!
Looking for a fun, engaging way to play games and chat with friends? Yalla brings together casual games and voice chat rooms, creating an unmatched social experience. Whether you're a fan of classic games or love connecting with new people, we’ve got you covered!

Key Features:
Casual Games to Enjoy Anytime
- Play popular games like Ludo, Carrom, UMO, and Baloot with friends or other players worldwide.
- Immerse yourself in friendly competitions, challenge players worldwide, and climb the leaderboards to prove your skills.
- Stay tuned—more exciting games are coming soon!

Voice Chat Rooms
- Join voice chat rooms to talk, laugh, and make new friends. Thousands of voice chat rooms are waiting for you.
- Go on the mic, send messages in chat, or exchange virtual gifts to enhance the fun.
- Play mini-games directly in the room for a lively group experience.

1-on-1 Private Chat
- Connect deeper with friends through private chat. Share messages, voice notes, and more in a personal space.

Post and Share
- Share your thoughts, game achievements, or fun moments with the community posts feature. Let others know what you're up to!

Why Choose Our App?
- All-in-One Experience: Play games, chat, and socialize in one seamless app.
- Global Community: Meet and interact with people from around the world.
- Fun and Interactive: Voice chat, gifts, and games make every moment exciting.

Follow us to get the latest news, updates and events:
Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/YallaVoiceChatRooms
Website: www.yalla.live
Dear YALLA users, your feedback and suggestions are welcome to: yallasupport@yalla.com<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></span> </div> <button class="svelte-1up5qog">more</button></p> </section> <section id="appEvents" data-test-id="shelf-wrapper" class="shelf svelte-1svznay    padding-top padding-bottom">  <div class="title-action-wrapper svelte-1mrndab">  <div class="link-contents svelte-1mrndab"><h2 class="shelf-title svelte-1mrndab" data-test-id="shelf-title">Events</h2> </div></div>    <div class="horizontal-shelf svelte-9mb6lb" data-test-id="horizontal-shelf"><section data-testid="shelf-component" class="shelf-grid shelf-grid--onhover svelte-13b6ljx" style="
