7 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166Z"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-1hjpbwc"><time class="date svelte-1hjpbwc" datetime="2019-06-07T12:55:34.000Z">07/06/2019</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1dta22y" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1dta22y"><p class="author svelte-1hjpbwc">Gabrialla Grombridge</p></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1hjpbwc">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-10e6dbh"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-10e6dbh" style="--lines: 5; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->I really love FaceTiming all of my friends at once, but I cannot do it on my own phone. When I am house partying on my phone other people can not hear me but I can hear them perfectly fine. I enabled everything except for the Facebook, I’ve uninstalled then reinstalled the app, and I restarted my phone. I even made a new account but it still won’t work! I highly recommend everyone to try the app because it is very safe and I am literally the only one having this problem. But if u could somehow fix this problem, then I would love this app forever and it would deserve a five star review. Sorry for the long review but I really want this fixed. In return it will be five stars ??<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  </div></div>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1p01z7" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u">