/06/2019</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1dta22y" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1dta22y"><p class="author svelte-1hjpbwc">Gabrialla Grombridge</p></span> </div></div></div> <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->I really love FaceTiming all of my friends at once, but I cannot do it on my own phone. When I am house partying on my phone other people can not hear me but I can hear them perfectly fine. I enabled everything except for the Facebook, I’ve uninstalled then reinstalled the app, and I restarted my phone. I even made a new account but it still won’t work! I highly recommend everyone to try the app because it is very safe and I am literally the only one having this problem. But if u could somehow fix this problem, then I would love this app forever and it would deserve a five star review. Sorry for the long review but I really want this fixed. In return it will be five stars ??<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> </p></div> </div> </div> </dialog> </div></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-1" data-index="1" aria-hidden="true"><div class="svelte-13b6ljx"><div class="container svelte-1hjpbwc" aria-labelledby="review-4275586546-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1hjpbwc"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1hjpbwc"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1dta22y" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1dta22y"><h3 id="review-4275586546-title" class="title svelte-1hjpbwc">My Opinion of Houseparty</h3></span> </div> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:12px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="5 Stars"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5