17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166Z"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166Z"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-1hjpbwc"><time class="date svelte-1hjpbwc" datetime="2019-06-06T11:17:05.000Z">06/06/2019</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1dta22y" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1dta22y"><p class="author svelte-1hjpbwc">Tsuyuko Biglin</p></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1hjpbwc">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-10e6dbh"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-10e6dbh" style="--lines: 5; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->I think this app is very cool. A huge struggle in youth culture is talking to friends all at once over the phone. This app solves the problem by creating a multiple people FaceTime system available for iPhones and Androids. This app also lets you use fun words such as “_____ is in the House” or “_______ wants to join” etc. This app is easy to use and functional while fun. All of my friends have it and it doesn’t go to waste. You should totally download this app, ASAP!!!<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  </div></div>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1p01z7" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d3u" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="content-modal-close-button-svg"><path d="M1.2 18C.6 18 0 17.5 0 16.8c0-.4.1-.6.4-.8l7-7-7-7c-.3-.2-.4-.5-.4-.8C0 .5.6 0 1.2 0c.3 0 .6.1.8.3l7 7 7-7c.2-.2.5-.3.8-.3.6 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 .3-.1.6-.4.8l-7 7 7 7c.2.2.4.5.4.8 0 .7-.6 1.2-1.2 1.2-.3 0-.6-.1-.8-.3l-7-7-7 7c-.2.1-.5.3-.8.3z"></path></svg></button> </div> <div class="header-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><h1 data-testid="content-modal-title" class="title svelte-1ih6d3u">Best</h1> </div> <div class="content-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><div class="container svelte-1hjpbwc is-detail-view" aria-labelledby="review-4272065528-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1hjpbwc"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1hjpbwc"> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:24px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="5 Stars"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166Z"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.