iew-header svelte-1hjpbwc"><time class="date svelte-1hjpbwc" datetime="2019-06-06T11:17:05.000Z">06/06/2019</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1dta22y" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1dta22y"><p class="author svelte-1hjpbwc">Tsuyuko Biglin</p></span> </div></div></div> <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->I think this app is very cool. A huge struggle in youth culture is talking to friends all at once over the phone. This app solves the problem by creating a multiple people FaceTime system available for iPhones and Androids. This app also lets you use fun words such as “_____ is in the House” or “_______ wants to join” etc. This app is easy to use and functional while fun. All of my friends have it and it doesn’t go to waste. You should totally download this app, ASAP!!!<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> </p></div> </div> </div> </dialog> </div></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-3" data-index="3" aria-hidden="true"><div class="svelte-13b6ljx"><div class="container svelte-1hjpbwc" aria-labelledby="review-9410709314-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1hjpbwc"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1hjpbwc"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1dta22y" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1dta22y"><h3 id="review-9410709314-title" class="title svelte-1hjpbwc">الاحتيال</h3></span> </div> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:12px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="5 Stars"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.