m":{}},"$kind":"WriteReviewAction","actionClass":"WriteReviewAction","adamId":"1091902866","url":"?id=1091902866","appName":"Yalla - Play Game & Voice Chat","itemDescription":"Game Together, Chat Anytime","appIcon":{"$kind":"Artwork","backgroundColor":{"red":0.5176470588235295,"green":0.984313725490196,"blue":0.6666666666666666,"type":"rgb"},"textColor":{"red":0,"green":0.03529411764705882,"blue":0.0196078431372549,"type":"rgb"},"style":"roundedRectPrerendered","crop":"bb","contentMode":null,"imageScale":null,"template":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/2c/9d/a8/2c9da851-5ee2-13f6-3ff5-3283cb0ff245/Placeholder.mill/{w}x{h}bb-70.png","width":1024,"height":1024,"variants":[{"$kind":"ArtworkVariant","format":"jpeg","quality":70,"supportsWideGamut":false}]}},"supportAction":{"title":"App Support","artwork":{"$kind":"Artwork","backgroundColor":null,"textColor":null,"style":null,"crop":"bb","contentMode":null,"imageScale":null,"template":"systemimage://questionmark.circle","width":0,"height":0,"variants":[{"$kind":"ArtworkVariant","format":"jpeg","quality":70,"supportsWideGamut":false}]},"presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[],"custom":{}},"$kind":"ExternalUrlAction","actionClass":"ExternalUrlAction","url":"http://www.yalla.live","isSensitive":false}}}],"url":null,"mergeWhenFetched":false,"fetchStrategy":"onPageLoad","batchGroup":null,"seeAllAction":null,"footerTitle":null,"footerAction":null,"eyebrow":null,"eyebrowArtwork":null,"footerStyle":null,"titleArtwork":null,"subtitle":null,"isHorizontal":false,"isHidden":false,"rowsPerColumn":null,"background":{"type":"none"},"contentsMetadata":{"type":"none"},"isPersonalized":false,"shouldFilterApps":false,"id":"allProductReviewActions"},"allProductReviews":{"$kind":"Shelf","impressionMetrics":null,"contentType":"productReview","marker":null,"items":[{"$kind":"ProductReview","componentType":"productReview","sourceType":"user","review":{"$kind":"Review","id":"4277751062","title":"Lights off?","date":"2019-06-07T12:55:34.000Z","dateText":"* null *","contents":"I really love FaceTiming all of my friends at once, but I cannot do it on my own phone. When I am house partying on my phone other people can not hear me but I can hear them perfectly fine. I enabled everything except for the Facebook, I’ve uninstalled then reinstalled the app, and I restarted my phone. I even made a new account but it still won’t work! I highly recommend everyone to try the app because it is very safe and I am literally the only one having this problem. But if u could somehow fix this problem, then I would love this app forever and it would deserve a five star review. Sorry for the long review but I really want this fixed. In return it will be five stars ??","rating":5,"reviewerName":"Gabrialla Grombridge","dateAuthorText":"* null * · Gabrialla Grombridge","moreAction":{"title":"Ratings & Reviews","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[],"custom":{}},"$kind":"flowAction","actionClass":"FlowAction","page":"reviews","pageData":{"shelves":[{"$kind":"Shelf","impressionMetrics":{"fields":{"id":"2","name":"","impressionType":"ratingsDetails","idType":"sequential","impressionIndex":0}},"contentType":"reviews","marker":null,"items":[{"$kind":"Review","id":"4277751062","title":"Lights off?","date":"2019-06-07T12:55:34.000Z","dateText":"* null *","contents":"I really love FaceTiming all of my friends at once, but I cannot do it on my own phone. When I am house partying on my phone other people can not hear me but I can hear them perfectly fine. I enabled everything except for the Facebook, I’ve uninstalled then reinstalled the app, and I restarted my phone. I even made a new account but it still won’t work! I highly recommend everyone to try the app because it is very safe and I am literally the only one having this problem. But if u could somehow fix this problem, then I would love this app forever and it would deserve a five star review. Sorry for the long review but I really want this fixed. In return it will be five stars ??","rating":5,"reviewerName":"Gabrialla Grombridge","dateAuthorText":"* null * · Gabrialla Grombridge"}],"url":null,"mergeWhenFetched":false,"fetchStrategy":"onPageLoad","batchGroup":null,"seeAllAction":null,"footerTitle":null,"footerAction":null,"eyebrow":null,"eyebrowArtwork":null,"footerStyle":null,"titleArtwork":null,"subtitle":null,"isHorizontal":false,"isHidden":false,"rowsPerColumn":null,"background":{"type":"none"},"contentsMetadata":{"type":"none"},"isPersonalized":false,"shouldFilterApps":false}],"presentationOptions":[],"isIncomplete":false,"pageMetrics":{"$kind":"PageMetrics","instructions":[],"custom":{}},"$kind":"ReviewsPage","adamId":"1091902866","targetReviewId":"4277751062"},"presentationContext":"infer","animationBehavior":"infer","origin":"inapp"}},"impressionMetrics":{"fields":{"id":"0","name":"","impressionType":"helpfulReview","idType":"sequential","impressionIndex":0}}},{"$kind":"ProductReview","componentType":"productReview","sourceType":"user","review":{"$kind":"Review","id":"4275586546","title":"My Opinion of Houseparty","date":"2019-06-07T03:13:37.000Z","dateText":"* null *","contents":"I really like this app because I recently moved schools and I miss all of my friends and especially my best friends. And before I knew about this I wanted to talk to another friend but then someone else wanted to talk to me and FaceTime didn’t have that feature at that time so all of my friends told me to get it and I got it and it was nice because I finally got to talk to all of my best friends that I was missing sooooo much!!!! Although sometimes it would cause me and my friends to get in fights and it wasn’t fun. But other than that it has helped me and my close friends that were drifting apart come together even more!!!!","rating":5,"reviewerName":"Taleigha Titchen","dateAuthorText":"* null * · Taleigha Titchen","moreAction":{"title":"Ratings & Reviews","prese