13+","productDescription":"Play 10 minutes a day to sharpen your thinking skills and keep your brain active.\n\nWord Box - Association is a brain-challenging game that encourages you to think from different perspectives and find 4 words that belong to the same category.\n\n●  Continuous Brain Training: Each level brings fresh content, new words, and unique ways to think.\n●  Daily Challenge: Take on one challenging level each day to give your brain a boost, and collect beautiful cards.\n●  Play with Other Players: Jump into the Word Tournament and test your skills against others online.\n●  Leaderboard: Rise to the top—pass high enough levels and claim your spot on the leaderboard.\n\nWe’re also adding more games to Word Box, offering new ways to train your brain from different angles with a variety of experiences, from relaxing to challenging. Stay tuned!","rating":5,"ratingCount":"1","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=6757417830&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=884847272"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","idType":"its_id","id":"6757417830"},{"locationPosition":9,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Word Box: Association","idType":"its_id","id":"6757417830"},{"locationPosition":12,"locationType":"swoosh","name":"More by Yalla Technology FZ-LLC","idType":"sequential","id":"30"}],"jet_adamId":"6757417830","eventType":"click","targetType":"button","targetId":"6757417830","platformContext":"iphone","alt_ab2_data":"[]"},"includingFields":["impressionsSnapshot","pageFields","contentRestrictionReasons","appState"],"excludingFields":["amsMetricsID"],"topic":"xp_amp_appstore_unidentified","shouldFlush":false}],"custom":{"jet_adamId":"6757417830"}},"$kind":"OfferAction","actionClass":"OfferAction","adamId":"6757417830","purchaseConfiguration":{"$kind":"PurchaseConfiguration","buyParams":