yTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Live,Voice,Group Chat Room","ageRating":"18+","productDescription":"Welcome to the Ultimate Game Community App!\nThis app centers on gameplay and match experience. Engage in battles across various modes, master rules, strategy, and controls to feel the clear rhythm of each match and the thrill of victory or defeat. Enjoy a more focused and immersive gaming experience.\n【Diverse Gameplay Modes】\nMultiple Game Modes\nChoose from a variety of modes, ranging from compact, variable strategy battles to relaxing, casual gameplay for stress relief.\nOptimized Core Experience\nWe optimize around core mechanics to ensure every match is smoother and more engaging, suitable for players with different preferences and paces.\n【Multiplayer Battles】\nMultiplayer Mode\nWe create a familiar yet distinctive visual experience for players.\nSupports 1–4 players per match with quick entry, allowing you to focus on the battle itself.\nWhether it's a personal challenge or a multiplayer confrontation, you can clearly feel the shift in momentum and the result of the match.\n【Free to Play】\nExperience the main game content without payment.\nJoin matches anytime and focus on enjoying the fun of strategy and control.\n【Global Matchmaking】\nBattle players from different regions in the same match.\nEvery game is full of changes and challenges, helping you continuously improve your judgment and adaptability.\n【Quick Play】\nReduced waiting time and fewer complex steps.\nEnter games quickly for a more focused and efficient experience.","rating":2.7,"ratingCount":"10","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=1519557264&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=884358272"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_